@startuml
title UC-001 — Isolated behavioral eval case execution
start
:Maintainer defines case, Required Outcome,
Hard Gates, and quality threshold;
:Harness provisions disposable isolated workspace,
case-only scope, and recording;
:Real Codex + harness execute workflow;
if (Side-effect violation?) then (yes)
  :Fail fast;
  :Preserve evidence through violation;
else (no)
  if (Non-side-effect policy violation?) then (yes)
    :Continue to completion;
  endif
endif
:Evaluator validates Hard Gates and Required Outcome;
:Score task_quality and trajectory_quality;
if (Valid evidence and all pass conditions?) then (yes)
  :Set case = passed;
else (no)
  if (Valid evidence?) then (yes)
    :Set case = failed;
  else (no)
    :Set case = inconclusive;
  endif
endif
:Retain result, trajectory, and evidence;
:Reset workspace and case isolation;
stop
@enduml
